    "title": "Karol G will take Coachella stage. How to watch her performance",
    "text": "April 19, 2026, 7:01 a.m. ETKarol G broke ceilings during weekend one of Coachella 2026.The Colombian singer became the first Latina to headline the festival on Sunday, April 12. Latin pride and girl power were at the forefront of her set.According to the Palm Springs Desert Sun, part of the USA TODAY Network, her special guests included Mariah Angeliq and Becky G.\"Forever Wild, Forever Free, LATINA FOREVA,\" she wrote in an Instagram post after her performance.Here's how to watch Karol G's Coachella performance on Sunday, April 19.When is Coachella 2026?The festival is two weekends: April 10-12 and April 17-19.When is Karol G headlining at Coachella 2026?Festivalgoers can expect Karol G to headline on both April 12 and April 19.When does Karol G perform at Coachella 2026 Weekend 2?Karol G will hit the Coachella stage at about 10:10 p.m. PDT. Her set will be streaming on YouTube during that time slot.Fans can watch Coachella performances on the video platform starting on April 17 at 4 p.m. PT/ 7 p.m. ET. Through the YouTube app on your TV, you can stream multiple stages simultaneously from your couch.Coachella 2026 Weekend 2 set timesA complete list of day-by-day set times can be found on Coachella's website or in an Instagram post below:Contributing: Ema Sasic, Palm Springs Desert SunTaylor Ardrey is a news reporter for USA TODAY. You can reach her at tardrey@usatodayco.com.",
